  "@graph": [
    {
      "@id": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "@type": "owl:Ontology",
      "title": {
        "en": "GS1 Site Access and Logistics Information Module",
        "de": "GS1-Modul für Standortzugang und Logistikinformationen",
        "fr": "Module GS1 pour l’accès au site et les informations logistiques",
        "it": "Modulo GS1 per l’accesso al sito e le informazioni logistiche"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Terms for describing how a physical site (GLN-identified gs1:Place) can be found and accessed by visitors, delivery drivers, suppliers, contractors and employees: access points, instructions, restrictions, access times, registration and contacts. Payload vocabulary for the GS1 Digital Link link types gs1:siteAccessInstructions (see note on gs1:siteAccessRequirements), gs1:logisticsInfo and gs1:scheduleTime. GS1 WebVoc terms are re-used first (gs1:Place, gs1:containsPlace, gs1:locationRole, gs1:ContactPoint, gs1:contactRoleCode, gs1:PostalAddress, gs1:GeoCoordinates, gs1:QuantitativeValue, gs1:referencedFile ...), then schema.org; only gaps are defined as new terms. All terms defined in this module are PROPOSED additions to the GS1 Web Vocabulary.",
        "de": "Begriffe zur Beschreibung, wie ein physischer Standort (GLN-identifizierter gs1:Place) von Besuchern, Lieferfahrern, Lieferanten, Auftragnehmern und Mitarbeitenden gefunden und betreten werden kann: Zugangspunkte, Anweisungen, Beschränkungen, Zugangszeiten, Registrierung und Kontakte. Nutzlastvokabular für die GS1-Digital-Link-Linktypen gs1:siteAccessInstructions (siehe Hinweis zu gs1:siteAccessRequirements), gs1:logisticsInfo und gs1:scheduleTime. Zuerst werden GS1-WebVoc-Begriffe wiederverwendet (gs1:Place, gs1:containsPlace, gs1:locationRole, gs1:ContactPoint, gs1:contactRoleCode, gs1:PostalAddress, gs1:GeoCoordinates, gs1:QuantitativeValue, gs1:referencedFile …), danach schema.org; nur Lücken werden als neue Begriffe definiert. Alle in diesem Modul definierten Begriffe sind VORGESCHLAGENE Ergänzungen des GS1 Web Vocabulary.",
        "fr": "Termes pour décrire comment un site physique (gs1:Place identifié par un GLN) peut être trouvé et accédé par des visiteurs, chauffeurs-livreurs, fournisseurs, prestataires externes et employés : points d’accès, instructions, restrictions, horaires d’accès, enregistrement et contacts. Vocabulaire de charge utile pour les types de lien GS1 Digital Link gs1:siteAccessInstructions (voir la note sur gs1:siteAccessRequirements), gs1:logisticsInfo et gs1:scheduleTime. Les termes GS1 WebVoc sont réutilisés en premier (gs1:Place, gs1:containsPlace, gs1:locationRole, gs1:ContactPoint, gs1:contactRoleCode, gs1:PostalAddress, gs1:GeoCoordinates, gs1:QuantitativeValue, gs1:referencedFile …), puis schema.org ; seules les lacunes sont définies comme nouveaux termes. Tous les termes définis dans ce module sont des ajouts PROPOSÉS au GS1 Web Vocabulary.",
        "it": "Termini per descrivere come un sito fisico (gs1:Place identificato da un GLN) può essere trovato e raggiunto da visitatori, autisti addetti alle consegne, fornitori, appaltatori e dipendenti: punti di accesso, istruzioni, restrizioni, orari di accesso, registrazione e contatti. Vocabolario del payload per i tipi di collegamento GS1 Digital Link gs1:siteAccessInstructions (vedi la nota su gs1:siteAccessRequirements), gs1:logisticsInfo e gs1:scheduleTime. Si riutilizzano per primi i termini GS1 WebVoc (gs1:Place, gs1:containsPlace, gs1:locationRole, gs1:ContactPoint, gs1:contactRoleCode, gs1:PostalAddress, gs1:GeoCoordinates, gs1:QuantitativeValue, gs1:referencedFile …), poi schema.org; solo le lacune sono definite come nuovi termini. Tutti i termini definiti in questo modulo sono aggiunte PROPOSTE al GS1 Web Vocabulary."
      },
      "versionInfo": "0.2.0-draft",
      "created": "2026-11-19",
      "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
      "seeAlso": [
        "https://ref.gs1.org/voc/",
        "http://schema.org/"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:AccessInstruction",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Access Instruction",
        "de": "Zugangsanweisung",
        "fr": "Instruction d’accès",
        "it": "Istruzione di accesso"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "A practical instruction: arrive, check in, park, load/unload, depart, emergency. Order steps with schema:position.",
        "de": "Eine praktische Anweisung: Ankunft, Anmeldung, Parken, Be- und Entladen, Abfahrt, Notfall. Die Schritte werden mit schema:position geordnet.",
        "fr": "Une instruction pratique : arrivée, enregistrement, stationnement, chargement/déchargement, départ, urgence. Les étapes sont ordonnées avec schema:position.",
        "it": "Un’istruzione pratica: arrivo, registrazione, parcheggio, carico/scarico, partenza, emergenza. I passaggi si ordinano con schema:position."
      },
      "subClassOf": "gs1:SiteAccessElement",
      "usedWithLinkType": [
        "gs1:logisticsInfo",
        "gs1:siteAccessInstructions",
        "gs1:siteAccessRequirements"
      ],
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:AccessRestriction",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Access Restriction",
        "de": "Zugangsbeschränkung",
        "fr": "Restriction d’accès",
        "it": "Restrizione di accesso"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "A prohibition, requirement, limit or advisory for entering or operating at the site. Machine-evaluable via restrictionType + restrictionMode + restrictionValue.",
        "de": "Ein Verbot, eine Vorgabe, ein Grenzwert oder eine Empfehlung für das Betreten oder den Betrieb am Standort. Maschinell auswertbar über restrictionType + restrictionMode + restrictionValue.",
        "fr": "Une interdiction, une exigence, une limite ou une recommandation pour l’entrée ou l’exploitation sur le site. Exploitable par machine via restrictionType + restrictionMode + restrictionValue.",
        "it": "Un divieto, un obbligo, un limite o una raccomandazione per l’ingresso o l’operatività nel sito. Valutabile automaticamente tramite restrictionType + restrictionMode + restrictionValue."
      },
      "subClassOf": "gs1:SiteAccessElement",
      "usedWithLinkType": [
        "gs1:logisticsInfo",
        "gs1:siteAccessInstructions",
        "gs1:siteAccessRequirements"
      ],
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:AccessRestrictionModeCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Access Restriction Mode Code",
        "de": "Wirkungsweise der Beschränkung",
        "fr": "Mode de la restriction",
        "it": "Modalità della restrizione"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "How a restriction operates. Code list in WebVoc style: members are gs1:AccessRestrictionModeCode-MEMBER_NAME and skos:Concepts.",
        "de": "Wie eine Beschränkung wirkt. Codeliste im WebVoc-Stil: Die Elemente heißen gs1:AccessRestrictionModeCode-MEMBER_NAME und sind skos:Concepts.",
        "fr": "La manière dont une restriction s’applique. Liste de codes dans le style WebVoc : les membres sont gs1:AccessRestrictionModeCode-MEMBER_NAME et des skos:Concept.",
        "it": "Come opera una restrizione. Lista di codici in stile WebVoc: i membri sono gs1:AccessRestrictionModeCode-MEMBER_NAME e skos:Concept."
      },
      "subClassOf": "skos:Concept",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:AccessRestrictionTypeCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Access Restriction Type Code",
        "de": "Art der Zugangsbeschränkung",
        "fr": "Type de restriction d’accès",
        "it": "Tipo di restrizione di accesso"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "The subject matter of an access restriction. Code list in WebVoc style: members are gs1:AccessRestrictionTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME and skos:Concepts.",
        "de": "Der Gegenstand einer Zugangsbeschränkung. Codeliste im WebVoc-Stil: Die Elemente heißen gs1:AccessRestrictionTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME und sind skos:Concepts.",
        "fr": "L’objet d’une restriction d’accès. Liste de codes dans le style WebVoc : les membres sont gs1:AccessRestrictionTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME et des skos:Concept.",
        "it": "L’oggetto di una restrizione di accesso. Lista di codici in stile WebVoc: i membri sono gs1:AccessRestrictionTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME e skos:Concept."
      },
      "subClassOf": "skos:Concept",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:AccessTimeWindow",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Access Time Window",
        "de": "Zugangszeitfenster",
        "fr": "Plage horaire d’accès",
        "it": "Fascia oraria di accesso"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "A recurring or dated time window in which access, visiting, delivery or collection is possible, restricted or closed. WebVoc has no opening-hours class (only the openingHoursInfo link type), so schema:OpeningHoursSpecification is specialised: schema:dayOfWeek, schema:opens, schema:closes and gs1:validFrom / gs1:validThrough (WebVoc, xsd:dateTime) are re-used.",
        "de": "Ein wiederkehrendes oder datiertes Zeitfenster, in dem Zutritt, Besuch, Anlieferung oder Abholung möglich, eingeschränkt oder geschlossen ist. WebVoc kennt keine Öffnungszeiten-Klasse (nur den Linktyp openingHoursInfo); deshalb wird schema:OpeningHoursSpecification spezialisiert: schema:dayOfWeek, schema:opens, schema:closes sowie gs1:validFrom / gs1:validThrough (WebVoc, xsd:dateTime) werden wiederverwendet.",
        "fr": "Une plage horaire récurrente ou datée pendant laquelle l’accès, la visite, la livraison ou l’enlèvement est possible, restreint ou fermé. WebVoc n’a pas de classe d’horaires d’ouverture (seulement le type de lien openingHoursInfo) ; schema:OpeningHoursSpecification est donc spécialisée : schema:dayOfWeek, schema:opens, schema:closes ainsi que gs1:validFrom / gs1:validThrough (WebVoc, xsd:dateTime) sont réutilisés.",
        "it": "Una fascia oraria ricorrente o datata in cui accesso, visita, consegna o ritiro sono possibili, limitati o chiusi. WebVoc non ha una classe per gli orari di apertura (solo il tipo di collegamento openingHoursInfo); si specializza quindi schema:OpeningHoursSpecification: si riutilizzano schema:dayOfWeek, schema:opens, schema:closes e gs1:validFrom / gs1:validThrough (WebVoc, xsd:dateTime)."
      },
      "subClassOf": [
        "gs1:SiteAccessElement",
        "schema:OpeningHoursSpecification"
      ],
      "usedWithLinkType": [
        "gs1:logisticsInfo",
        "gs1:scheduleTime",
        "gs1:siteAccessInstructions",
        "gs1:siteAccessRequirements"
      ],
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:AccessTimeWindowTypeCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Access Time Window Type Code",
        "de": "Art des Zeitfensters",
        "fr": "Type de plage horaire",
        "it": "Tipo di fascia oraria"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "The purpose of a time window. Code list in WebVoc style: members are gs1:AccessTimeWindowTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME and skos:Concepts.",
        "de": "Der Zweck eines Zeitfensters. Codeliste im WebVoc-Stil: Die Elemente heißen gs1:AccessTimeWindowTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME und sind skos:Concepts.",
        "fr": "La finalité d’une plage horaire. Liste de codes dans le style WebVoc : les membres sont gs1:AccessTimeWindowTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME et des skos:Concept.",
        "it": "Lo scopo di una fascia oraria. Lista di codici in stile WebVoc: i membri sono gs1:AccessTimeWindowTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME e skos:Concept."
      },
      "subClassOf": "skos:Concept",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:LocationGuidance",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Location Guidance",
        "de": "Ortshinweis",
        "fr": "Indications de localisation",
        "it": "Indicazioni di localizzazione"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "Practical help to find the site or an access point: navigation address, route, signage, warnings. General descriptions use WebVoc gs1:locationDescription; maps use gs1:referencedFile.",
        "de": "Praktische Hilfe, um den Standort oder einen Zugangspunkt zu finden: Navigationsadresse, Route, Beschilderung, Warnungen. Allgemeine Beschreibungen nutzen gs1:locationDescription aus WebVoc; Karten nutzen gs1:referencedFile.",
        "fr": "Aide pratique pour trouver le site ou un point d’accès : adresse de navigation, itinéraire, signalisation, avertissements. Les descriptions générales utilisent gs1:locationDescription de WebVoc ; les plans utilisent gs1:referencedFile.",
        "it": "Aiuto pratico per trovare il sito o un punto di accesso: indirizzo di navigazione, percorso, segnaletica, avvisi. Le descrizioni generali usano gs1:locationDescription di WebVoc; le mappe usano gs1:referencedFile."
      },
      "subClassOf": "gs1:SiteAccessElement",
      "usedWithLinkType": [
        "gs1:logisticsInfo",
        "gs1:siteAccessInstructions",
        "gs1:siteAccessRequirements"
      ],
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:RegistrationCredentialTypeCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Registration Credential Type Code",
        "de": "Art des Nachweises",
        "fr": "Type de justificatif",
        "it": "Tipo di documento da presentare"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "Information or document to be presented. Code list in WebVoc style: members are gs1:RegistrationCredentialTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME and skos:Concepts.",
        "de": "Vorzulegende Angabe oder vorzulegendes Dokument. Codeliste im WebVoc-Stil: Die Elemente heißen gs1:RegistrationCredentialTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME und sind skos:Concepts.",
        "fr": "Information ou document à présenter. Liste de codes dans le style WebVoc : les membres sont gs1:RegistrationCredentialTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME et des skos:Concept.",
        "it": "Informazione o documento da presentare. Lista di codici in stile WebVoc: i membri sono gs1:RegistrationCredentialTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME e skos:Concept."
      },
      "subClassOf": "skos:Concept",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:RegistrationMethodCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Registration Method Code",
        "de": "Registrierungsweg",
        "fr": "Mode d’enregistrement",
        "it": "Modalità di registrazione"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "How registration, booking or announcement is done. Code list in WebVoc style: members are gs1:RegistrationMethodCode-MEMBER_NAME and skos:Concepts.",
        "de": "Wie Registrierung, Buchung oder Anmeldung erfolgt. Codeliste im WebVoc-Stil: Die Elemente heißen gs1:RegistrationMethodCode-MEMBER_NAME und sind skos:Concepts.",
        "fr": "La manière dont l’enregistrement, la réservation ou l’annonce se fait. Liste de codes dans le style WebVoc : les membres sont gs1:RegistrationMethodCode-MEMBER_NAME et des skos:Concept.",
        "it": "Come avviene la registrazione, la prenotazione o l’annuncio. Lista di codici in stile WebVoc: i membri sono gs1:RegistrationMethodCode-MEMBER_NAME e skos:Concept."
      },
      "subClassOf": "skos:Concept",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:RegistrationRequirement",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Registration Requirement",
        "de": "Registrierungsanforderung",
        "fr": "Exigence d’enregistrement",
        "it": "Requisito di registrazione"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "What must be arranged before or on arrival: book a slot, pre-register, present credentials, complete an induction.",
        "de": "Was vor oder bei der Ankunft zu veranlassen ist: Slot buchen, vorab registrieren, Nachweise vorlegen, eine Einweisung absolvieren.",
        "fr": "Ce qui doit être organisé avant ou à l’arrivée : réserver un créneau, s’enregistrer à l’avance, présenter des justificatifs, suivre une induction.",
        "it": "Ciò che va organizzato prima o all’arrivo: prenotare uno slot, preregistrarsi, presentare documenti, completare una formazione introduttiva."
      },
      "subClassOf": "gs1:SiteAccessElement",
      "usedWithLinkType": [
        "gs1:logisticsInfo",
        "gs1:siteAccessInstructions",
        "gs1:siteAccessRequirements"
      ],
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:RequiredEquipmentTypeCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Required Equipment Type Code",
        "de": "Erforderliche Ausrüstung",
        "fr": "Équipement requis",
        "it": "Attrezzatura richiesta"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "Equipment a person or vehicle must wear or carry. Code list in WebVoc style: members are gs1:RequiredEquipmentTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME and skos:Concepts.",
        "de": "Ausrüstung, die eine Person oder ein Fahrzeug tragen bzw. mitführen muss. Codeliste im WebVoc-Stil: Die Elemente heißen gs1:RequiredEquipmentTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME und sind skos:Concepts.",
        "fr": "Équipement qu’une personne ou un véhicule doit porter ou avoir à bord. Liste de codes dans le style WebVoc : les membres sont gs1:RequiredEquipmentTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME et des skos:Concept.",
        "it": "Attrezzatura che una persona o un veicolo deve indossare o avere con sé. Lista di codici in stile WebVoc: i membri sono gs1:RequiredEquipmentTypeCode-MEMBER_NAME e skos:Concept."
      },
      "subClassOf": "skos:Concept",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:SiteAccessElement",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Site Access Element",
        "de": "Zugangselement",
        "fr": "Élément d’accès",
        "it": "Elemento di accesso"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "Abstract superclass of statement-level elements. Carries cross-cutting qualifiers addressedTo, appliesToAccessPoint, applicableVehicleType, isMandatory. The same qualifiers are used on gs1:Place (access points) and gs1:ContactPoint.",
        "de": "Abstrakte Oberklasse der Aussageelemente. Trägt die übergreifenden Qualifizierer addressedTo, appliesToAccessPoint, applicableVehicleType und isMandatory. Dieselben Qualifizierer werden an gs1:Place (Zugangspunkten) und gs1:ContactPoint verwendet.",
        "fr": "Superclasse abstraite des éléments d’énoncé. Porte les qualificatifs transversaux addressedTo, appliesToAccessPoint, applicableVehicleType et isMandatory. Les mêmes qualificatifs sont utilisés sur gs1:Place (points d’accès) et gs1:ContactPoint.",
        "it": "Superclasse astratta degli elementi di affermazione. Porta i qualificatori trasversali addressedTo, appliesToAccessPoint, applicableVehicleType e isMandatory. Gli stessi qualificatori si usano su gs1:Place (punti di accesso) e gs1:ContactPoint."
      },
      "subClassOf": "schema:Thing",
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:SiteAccessInformation",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Site Access Information",
        "de": "Standortzugangsinformation",
        "fr": "Informations d’accès au site",
        "it": "Informazioni di accesso al sito"
      },
      "comment": {
        "en": "Root node of a site access / logistics information document for one site (gs1:Place). Aggregates access instructions, restrictions, access times, registration requirements and location guidance; contacts and access points hang on the gs1:Place itself (gs1:contactPoint, gs1:containsPlace). Inherits schema:CreativeWork metadata (inLanguage, dateModified, version).",
        "de": "Wurzelknoten eines Dokuments mit Zugangs- und Logistikinformationen für einen Standort (gs1:Place). Bündelt Zugangsanweisungen, Beschränkungen, Zeitfenster, Registrierungsanforderungen und Ortshinweise; Kontakte und Zugangspunkte hängen am gs1:Place selbst (gs1:contactPoint, gs1:containsPlace). Erbt die Metadaten von schema:CreativeWork (inLanguage, dateModified, version).",
        "fr": "Nœud racine d’un document d’informations d’accès et de logistique pour un site (gs1:Place). Regroupe les instructions d’accès, restrictions, plages horaires, exigences d’enregistrement et indications de localisation ; les contacts et points d’accès se rattachent au gs1:Place lui-même (gs1:contactPoint, gs1:containsPlace). Hérite des métadonnées de schema:CreativeWork (inLanguage, dateModified, version).",
        "it": "Nodo radice di un documento con informazioni di accesso e logistica per un sito (gs1:Place). Riunisce istruzioni di accesso, restrizioni, fasce orarie, requisiti di registrazione e indicazioni di localizzazione; contatti e punti di accesso sono collegati al gs1:Place stesso (gs1:contactPoint, gs1:containsPlace). Eredita i metadati di schema:CreativeWork (inLanguage, dateModified, version)."
      },
      "subClassOf": "schema:CreativeWork",
      "usedWithLinkType": [
        "gs1:logisticsInfo",
        "gs1:scheduleTime",
        "gs1:siteAccessInstructions",
        "gs1:siteAccessRequirements"
      ],
      "isDefinedBy": "gs1:module/siteAccess",
      "termStatus": "unstable"
    },
    {
      "@id": "gs1:SiteAccessRoleCode",
      "@type": "owl:Class",
      "label": {
        "en": "Site Access Role Code",
        "de": "Rolle für den Standortzugang",
        "fr": "Rôle pour l’accès au site",
        "it": "Ruolo per l’accesso al sito"
      },
      "comment": {
